# BizMatch AI Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API Base URL
# In local development: http://localhost:8000/api
# In production on Vercel: Set to your deployed Render URL, e.g. https://bizmatch-ai-backend.onrender.com/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:8000/api"

# Optional: Internal backend URL for Next.js server-side API proxy rewrites
BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL="http://localhost:8000"
